  "body": "Perfectly positioned on a generous 606sqm (more or less) freehold section in sought-after Bucklands Beach, this beautifully renovated home offers modern comfort, versatile living spaces and fantastic indoor-outdoor flow. With renovations completed both inside and out, this impressive property is ready for its new owners to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a light-filled open-plan living and dining area, seamlessly connected to a modern kitchen featuring quality appliances, stylish cabinetry and ample bench space. Three generous double bedrooms, all with built-in wardrobes, are complemented by a beautifully renovated family bathroom with a separate shower and bathtub, plus an additional guest's powder room.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the spacious master bedroom offers a peaceful retreat, complete with ensuite and direct access to a sun-drenched deck through a ranch slider. Multiple outdoor decking areas provide the perfect spaces to unwind, entertain and soak up the sunshine throughout the day.\r\n\r\nAdding exceptional flexibility, the lower level features a second living area with its own wardrobe and separate entrance. Perfect for extended family, teenagers, guests or working from home, this versatile space also offers potential for additional income.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced and gated section provides a secure environment for children and pets. A single garage, additional on-site parking and secure off-street parking ensure everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to local schools, beautiful beaches, parks, shops and amenities, this outstanding Bucklands Beach home delivers the perfect combination of modern living, generous space and lifestyle flexibility.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated, wonderfully versatile and ready to enjoy - this is an opportunity not to be missed. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our open homes.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
